1
00:00:00,790 --> 00:00:04,660
(Sheldon:)I can barely hear you
over my theremin.

2
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,970
(Sheldon:)Well, that was a
little uncalled for.

3
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:14,930
(Leonard:)No, that was
completely called for.

4
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,290
(Leonard:)We need quiet.

5
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:18,640
(Sheldon:)So, your project is more
important than mine?

6
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:22,880
(Leonard:)Well, seeing as your project
is to sabotage my project, yes.

7
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,440
(Sheldon:)Don't beat around the bush,
Leonard.

8
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:25,480
(Sheldon:)If you don't want me here,

9
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,410
(Sheldon:)just say the word,
and I'll leave.

10
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,350
(Sheldon:)Could have beaten
around the bush a little.

11
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:41,260
♪ Nobody knows ♪

12
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:44,230
♪ The trouble I've seen ♪

13
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:49,740
♪ Nobody knows my sorrow ♪

14
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:53,170
♪ Oh, oh, oh. ♪

15
00:00:53,170 --> 00:00:54,810
(Penny:)What you doing?

16
00:00:54,810 --> 00:00:57,140
(Penny:)Trying to contact
your home planet?

17
00:00:57,140 --> 00:00:59,710
(Sheldon:)I'm practicing my theremin.

18
00:00:59,710 --> 00:01:01,580
(Leonard:)Oh.

